  "A KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) is required.": ["A KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) est nécessaire.", "En KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) krävs.", "A KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) è richiesto.", "Een KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) is vereist.", "A KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959) é necessária.", "A KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959)이 필요합니다.", "A 個 KingSun KS-959 (07d0:4959)是需要的.", "يلزم المحوّل KingSun KS-959 ‏(07d0:4959)."],
  "KS-959 receive stream synchronized.": ["KS-959 recevoir le flux synchronisé.", "KS-959 får ström synkroniserad.", "KS-959 ricevere flusso sincronizzato.", "KS-959 ontvangen stream gesynchroniseerd.", "KS-959 receber fluxo sincronizado.", "KS-959 스트림 동기화.", "KS-959 接收流同步。", "KS-959 يتلقى تيارا متزامنا."],
